I have looked at the source code and discovered that the wand of cancellation
have the following effects on monsters, in addition to those printed
in the hint files:

'A' can't weaken you
'c' decreases your chances of being petrified
'F' will not explode
'g' its juices will not freeze you
'h' its bite will not put you to sleep
'k' cancels its poison sting
'N' cancels its seduction but ONLY if you are not blind
'P' will not swallow you
'R' can only rust your helmet
'S' cancels its poisonous bite
'v' can't hold you
'y' will not blind you

While we're on the topic of wands, I have listed them in order of their
probability of occurrence:

wand			prob.	type
----			-----	----
light			.10	NODIR
magic missile		.10	RAY
striking		.09	IMMEDIATE
make invisible		.09	IMMEDIATE

secret door detection	.05	NODIR
