slow monster		.05	IMMEDIATE
speed monster		.05	IMMEDIATE
undead turning		.05	IMMEDIATE
polymorph		.05	IMMEDIATE
cancellation		.05	IMMEDIATE
teleport monster	.05	IMMEDIATE
digging			.05	RAY
fire			.05	RAY
